target: vps-static+vps-service
host: hetzner-ml-fasl-work
hostname: neuraxis.ml.fasl-work.com
static: /var/www/neuraxis.ml.fasl-work.com
service: bounded native operations API, systemd managed
source_visibility: public
decision:
  - The committed research payload contains 14,400 canonical episodes and is too large for a small static Pages deployment.
  - The operations API requires a separately bounded native service; GitHub Pages cannot host it.
  - Static assets and the service share the measured ML host with immutable static releases and per-release service environments.
  - Product data, checkpoints, operator workspaces, credentials, and training environments remain outside the public static archive.
